      <section class="light-section section-pad" aria-labelledby="interpreter-title">
        <div class="container about-grid">
          <div class="about-left">
            <span class="mono chapter-tag">03 / INTERPRETER</span>
            <h2 id="interpreter-title">From task plan to execution request</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="about-right">
            <p>The Interpreter is the handoff between task reasoning and motion planning. Its role is to check the plan and its object references, then package the task intent and relevant scene evidence into a request for Linux. This handoff is part of the ongoing integration.</p>
